        "usableClipYield": 0,
        "reason": "Viewer-oriented head turn is readable, but broader/lower body and lower/rearranged feet interrupt quiet stance. The visible source pop survives the common crop/codec, so this alternative remains held."
      }
    ],
    "semanticLookGainRecommended": 1,
    "normalSizeEvidence": "Actual237CSS full stage, density1, raw and common-crop codec on light/dark. Own live neutral60\u2192pose18\u2192neutral12@30Hz verifies60\u201377 attention, exact78 neutral return and89 terminal through3000ms without page errors. Shared transparent margin crop is drawn at the original full-stage origin; visible bird scale is preserved. Minor stance-detail redraw is judged visually rather than by an automatic RGBA equality or alpha-probe gate.",
    "technicalSeparation": "Both frozen canonical pixel pairs PASS; actual canonical JSON190312/194554bytes PASS. Neither technical PASS establishes anatomy, physical contact, full production schema or current Mac admission.",
    "recommendation": "Keep look-v1 as a provisional bounded source look candidate and look-v2 held. Prior historical holds remain retained evidence; this current same-source presentation review does not overwrite history, prove support, or activate a binding. Runtime NOT_TESTED; full schema, pins and live yard acceptance require independent integration. No automatic generation/retry."
